      "name": "Ahmed Osama",
      "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:43:13.831Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Retail, restaurants, and multi-branch businesses need more than just a POS — they need <strong>speed, reliability, and full ERP integration</strong>.<br>\nThat’s exactly what <strong>POS Next</strong> delivers.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/high_voltage.png?v=15\" title=\":high_voltage:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":high_voltage:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <strong>POS Next</strong> is a modern, open-source Point of Sale system built natively for <strong>ERPNext v15+</strong>, combining real-time power, offline freedom, and a sleek modern interface — all free under <strong>AGPL-3.0</strong>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h3><a name=\"p-484064-why-pos-next-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484064-why-pos-next-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/light_bulb.png?v=15\" title=\":light_bulb:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":light_bulb:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Why POS Next?</h3>\n<p>POS Next was designed to solve the common frustrations with traditional POS systems in the ERPNext ecosystem.<br>\nIt’s <strong>built from scratch</strong> for performance, user experience, and scalability.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <strong>Offline-First Experience</strong> — keep selling even with no internet; syncs automatically once back online.<br>\n<img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <strong>Lightning-Fast UI</strong> — Vue 3 frontend with instant search, barcode scan, and keyboard shortcuts.<br>\n<img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <strong>Deep ERPNext Integration</strong> — real-time sync with invoices, stock, price lists, and accounting.<br>\n<img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <strong>Multi-Company, Multi-Currency</strong> — ready for global use.<br>\n<img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <strong>Smart Offers &amp; Coupons</strong> — flexible promotions, discounts, and loyalty support.<br>\n<img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <strong>Shift Management &amp; Reports</strong> — track sales, cash, and operators with accuracy.<br>\n<img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <strong>Open Source</strong> — audit, customize, or extend freely.</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><a name=\"p-484064-built-on-frappe-powered-by-community-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484064-built-on-frappe-powered-by-community-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/brain.png?v=15\" title=\":brain:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":brain:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Built on Frappe — Powered by Community</h3>\n<p>POS Next is built entirely with <strong>Frappe Framework + Vue 3</strong>, offering a developer-friendly architecture:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">[ POS Next UI (Vue 3) ]\n        ↓\n[ IndexedDB Offline Cache ]\n        ↓\n[ Frappe APIs / ERPNext Integration ]\n</code></pre>\n<p>This means seamless compatibility with your existing ERPNext setup, and a foundation you can <strong>extend, theme, or automate</strong> to match your business needs.</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><a name=\"p-484064-ideal-for-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484064-ideal-for-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/convenience_store.png?v=15\" title=\":convenience_store:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":convenience_store:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Ideal For</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Retail &amp; supermarket chains</li>\n<li>Restaurants and cafés</li>\n<li>Electronics &amp; fashion stores</li>\n<li>Multi-branch businesses needing unified reporting</li>\n<li>Developers and service providers building custom POS workflows</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><a name=\"p-484064-quick-start-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484064-quick-start-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/gear.png?v=15\" title=\":gear:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":gear:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Quick Start</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Install the app</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">bench get-app https://github.com/BrainWise-DEV/POSNext\nbench --site [your-site] install-app pos_next\nbench build --app pos_next\nbench restart\n</code></pre>\n<ol start=\"2\">\n<li><strong>Setup your POS Profile</strong> (company, warehouse, price list, currency).</li>\n<li><strong>Start Selling</strong> → Visit <code>/pos</code> and enjoy a new generation of Point of Sale.</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h3><a name=\"p-484064-our-vision-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484064-our-vision-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/globe_showing_europe_africa.png?v=15\" title=\":globe_showing_europe_africa:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":globe_showing_europe_africa:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Our Vision</h3>\n<p>We’re building the next generation of ERPNext POS — open, community-driven, and constantly improving.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/hammer_and_wrench.png?v=15\" title=\":hammer_and_wrench:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":hammer_and_wrench:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Upcoming features include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Restaurant table management &amp; kitchen display system (KDS)</li>\n<li>Loyalty &amp; reward programs</li>\n<li>Advanced analytics dashboard</li>\n<li>Payment gateway integrations</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><a name=\"p-484064-join-the-movement-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484064-join-the-movement-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/handshake.png?v=15\" title=\":handshake:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":handshake:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Join the Movement</h3>\n<p>POS Next is 100% open source and community-driven.<br>\nWe welcome contributions, feature ideas, and bug reports from the Frappe community.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/speech_balloon.png?v=15\" title=\":speech_balloon:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":speech_balloon:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Try it. Star it. Contribute to it.<br>\n<img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/backhand_index_pointing_right.png?v=15\" title=\":backhand_index_pointing_right:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":backhand_index_pointing_right:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/BrainWise-DEV/POSNext?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">GitHub Repository → POS Next</a></strong></p>\n<p>Together, let’s build the fastest, smartest, and most flexible POS ever made for ERPNext.</p>",
